  "details": "I don't know how to delete this but I solved the issue.\nI had the Action Layer unbound (no controller), that was the cause!\n\nI'm not sure what's causing this, but any animation controller logic outside of basic toggles are not persisting on any version of the avatar besides the local mirror clone. The animation makes it effect shown for only a split second before resetting.\nAvatar ID: avtr_663e3045-2155-4163-ae14-9b250707fd32\nI'm not doing anything non standard, no Write Defaults, and the animations that have broken aren't using anything fancy like VRC Parameter Driver.\nHere is a video showing the issue: https://youtu.be/oZQzEH7Orbo",
